CHAPTER.VERS:
Yea, and
He takes the cause of his Church in hand against the enemy, as though the injury were done to himself. what have ye to do with me, O Tyre, and Zidon, and all the coasts of Palestine? will ye render me
Have I done you wrong, that you will render me the same? a recompence? and if ye recompense me, swiftly [and] speedily will I return your recompence upon your own head;
